		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>A dizzying contraption of gears, pistons, and countless metal parts shaped like a 20- foot-long winged dragon.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 15, <strong>HP</strong> 58, <strong>ATK</strong> 3 rend +9 (2d8) or 1 fire breath, <strong>MV</strong> double near (fly, swim), <strong>S</strong> +4, <strong>D</strong> +2, <strong>C</strong> +4, <strong>I</strong> -2, <strong>W</strong> +0, <strong>Ch</strong> -2, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 12</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Clockwork</strong>. Immune to damage from fire, cold, or non-magical sources. Double damage from electricity.</p><p></p><p><strong>Fire Breath</strong>. Fills a near-sized cube extending from dragon. CON 15+ or 3d6 damage. Cannot use again for 1d4 rounds.</p><p></p><p><strong>Self-Destruct</strong>. On next turn when reduced below 15 HP, explodes. Near-sized cube centered on dragon, DEX 15+ or 3d6 damage.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
